      "data": {
        "body": "Events are capabilities declared by emitting nodes or their classes. Import Bridges own subscriptions to exposed neighbor events. Event Handler nodes own reactions and call connected Method nodes. Deliver that model with a clear migration path and live in-memory behavior.",
